instructions.description:
This function parses a JSON string and returns an equivalent storage value.

##### Example 1:
Parse a stringified JSON object
```furo
[
  {
    "id": "sPtxHVHIdnw1q5JJUoMyg",
    "type": "call",
    "callee": "local/parse_json",
    "parameters": [
      {
        "type": "tel",
        "name": "json",
        "expression": "\"{ \\\"message\\\": \\\"Hello World\\\" }\""
      }
    ],
    "storeAs": "parsed"
  }
]
```
will store following object as `parsed`: 
```
{
  message: "Hello World"
}
```

This function performs serialization of a storage value to JSON format string. 

##### Example 1:
Convert object to JSON string.
```furo
[
  {
    "id": "5QX098PQbGRWRdNBNdEUu",
    "type": "call",
    "callee": "local/to_json",
    "parameters": [
      {
        "type": "tel",
        "name": "value",
        "expression": "{\n  message: \"Hello World\"\n}"
      }
    ],
    "storeAs": "json"
  }
]
```
will store following string (raw data) as `json`: 
```
{"message":"Hello World"}}
```

##### Example 2:
Convert object to JSON string with pretty spacing.
```furo
[
  {
    "id": "XoalSW-MH0lwbU-IxGmWA",
    "type": "call",
    "callee": "local/to_json",
    "parameters": [
      {
        "type": "tel",
        "name": "value",
        "expression": "{\n  message: \"Hello World\",\n  details: {\n    status: 200\n  }\n}"
      },
      {
        "type": "tel",
        "name": "pretty",
        "expression": "true"
      }
    ],
    "storeAs": "json"
  }
]
```
will store following string (raw data) as `json`: 
```
{
  "message": "Hello World",
  "details": {
    "status": 200
  }
}
```
